sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as UserGroupController
    participant Impact as ImpactAnalyzer
    participant UG as UserGroupModule
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>FE: Assign Role
    FE->>API: Preview assignment

    API->>Impact: calculate Group affected count
    Impact->>DB: Read current membership
    DB-->>Impact: employee count
    Impact-->>API: impact

    API-->>FE: Show impact
    Admin->>FE: Confirm

    FE->>API: Add Role assignment
    API->>UG: assignRole()

    UG->>DB: BEGIN
    UG->>DB: Insert UserGroup-Role assignment
    UG->>DB: Increment User Group version
    UG->>DB: COMMIT

    UG-->>API: status=PENDING
    API-->>FE: Pending synchronization
